  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'The only pious one in the family, after all. '
  - speaker: 1
    text: "That said, we haven\u2019t heard from the last exp\xE9dition in a while."
  - speaker: 0
    text: Who was that person? I thought I had understood that she was a very courageous
      person from what is said about the inhabitants of the village below.
  - speaker: 1
    text: Courageous she is, but her family was filled with unbelievers, impious
      and eager to wreak chaos in our community!
  - speaker: 0
    text: But ... where is this family now?
  - speaker: 1
    text: "It\u2019s no longer the time to ask questions, traveler..."
